  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      181.27,
      124.93,
      496.4,
      148.0
    ],
    "text": "DescriptionExcise DutyIII",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      76.39,
      171.97,
      401.28,
      225.04
    ],
    "text": "1. Motor vehicles, which were imported during the period of January 2015 toNovember 2017 and pending for Customs clearance at the Port of Sri Lanka(Hambantota) shall be released to the importer(s) subject to fulfilling thefollowing criteria :",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.99,
      242.05,
      401.28,
      267.04
    ],
    "text": "(i) Said motor vehicles imported by an importer / individual based on theLetter(s) of Credit established on his/her name for personal usage or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      97.63,
      284.05,
      401.29,
      351.04
    ],
    "text": "(ii) Said motor vehicles imported by any authorized agent / motor vehiclesimporter on the request of identified customer(s), who have paidrequired money to the said authorized agent / importer through anyofficial channel(s) (financial institutions approved by the Central Bankof Sri Lanka) for importation of such vehicle(s) for personal usage.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      76.39,
      368.05,
      401.29,
      463.0
    ],
    "text": "2. Any importer or individual, fulfilling criteria listed above, shall submit his /her application as specified in the Schedule II of this Gazette Notification, tothe Director General, Department of Fiscal Policy of the General Treasuryalong with all official / duly certified copies of evidence for authorizingclearance of such motor vehicle(s) from the Sri Lanka Customs on paymentof Excise duty specified in Column II of Schedule I within four (04) monthsperiod from the date of publication of this Gazette Notification.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      76.39,
      480.01,
      401.28,
      575.08
    ],
    "text": "3. All motor vehicles, cleared from the Sri Lanka Customs under the proposedconcession shall be registered in the name of the individuals referred in Iabove within 30 days from the date of release of such motor vehicles fromthe Sri Lanka Customs. Any motor vehicle, not be registered within 30 daysfrom the date of release of Sri Lanka Customs, shall be liable for payment ofapplicable excise duty at the time of release of such motor vehicle from theSri Lanka Customs",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      417.67,
      170.65,
      532.29,
      217.72
    ],
    "text": "The rate of Excise dutyapplicable at the time ofestablishment of theirrespective Letters of Credit",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
